[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      7[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Result
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **The translation is correct.** No behavioral divergence was found, so no change
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m was made to `src/lib.rs`. Two defects were found and fixed in the *verification
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m harness*, one of which had made the entire suite vacuous.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
