[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m |----------|----------------|
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `SYMBOLS.md` | all 9 exported symbols; C↔Rust `nm -D` diff is empty |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `ERRORS.md` | 34 rejection/error rows, each with a passing differential test |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `CONFIGS.md` | 44 valid-configuration rows, each randomized with a fixed seed |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `tests/symbols.rs` | Phase D symbol parity, asserted (3 tests) |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `tests/valid_paths.rs` | Phase B (28 tests) |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `tests/errors.rs` | Phase C (20 tests) |
